---
import BaseHead from "../../components/BaseHead.astro"
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro"
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro"
import BreakpointIndicator from "../../components/BreakpointIndicator.astro"
import TwoColumnSection from "../../components/TwoColumnSection.astro"
import LatestBlogPosts from "../../components/LatestBlogPosts.astro"
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import jp02 from "/src/assets/circuits/03japan/jp02.jpg"
import bh03 from "/src/assets/circuits/04bahrain/bh03.jpg"
import kimiPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/antonelli-headcrop-01.png"
import bearmanPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/bearman-headcrop-01.png"
import hadjarPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/hadjar-headcrop-01.png"
import bortoletoPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/bortoleto-headcrop-01.png"
import doohanPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/doohan-headcrop-01.png"
import lawsonPortrait from "/src/assets/drivers/f1/2024/lawson-headcrop-01.png"

const pageTitle = "Future of Formula 1"
const description =
	"Discover what lies ahead for Formula 1 as we explore emerging technologies, sustainability initiatives, and the next generation of racing talent."
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={pageTitle}
			description={description}
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<BreakpointIndicator />
		<Header />

		<main>
			<!-- Hero Section -->
			<div class="py-10 text-center">
				<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
					{pageTitle}
				</h1>
				<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
						Formula 1 has always been at the forefront of technological advancements, and the future
						promises to be no different. From cutting-edge aerodynamics to hybrid power units, the
						sport continues to evolve, pushing the boundaries of speed, efficiency, and performance.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-xl">
					<Image
						src={bh03}
						alt="weepah"
						loading="eager"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Data & Analytics Section -->
			<TwoColumnSection
				title="Data and analytical revolution"
				content={`
        <p>
          The increasing use of data and analytics in Formula 1 is
          transforming the sport and opening up new possibilities for
          innovation and discovery. F1 teams are already using data to
          optimize car performance, track conditions, and race strategies, but
          with the emergence of new technologies such as artificial
          intelligence and machine learning, the potential for data-driven
          advancements in F1 is limitless.
        </p>
        <p>
          To keep up with this data-driven revolution, F1 engineers will need
          to have exceptional skills in data analysis and interpretation, and
          teams will need to invest in the latest technologies and tools. This
          focus on data will not only make F1 more competitive, but it will
          also drive breakthroughs and advancements with far-reaching impacts
          beyond the sport.
        </p>
      `}
				imageSrc={jp02}
				imageAlt="F1 Data Analytics"
				background="gray"
			/>

			<!-- New Innovations Section -->
			<TwoColumnSection
				title="New innovations and dynamics"
				content={`
        <p>
          The future of the sport also promises to be shaped by a more diverse
          and inclusive culture. F1 is taking steps to increase diversity and
          representation in the sport, including the launch of the We Race As
          One initiative, which aims to promote diversity and inclusion both
          on and off the track.
        </p>
        <p>
          As the sport becomes more diverse and inclusive, it will bring new
          perspectives and ideas to the engineering and design of the cars and
          the sport as a whole. This will not only make F1 more representative
          of the global community, but it will also help to attract new talent
          and create a more sustainable and innovative future for the sport.
        </p>
      `}
				imageSrc={jp02}
				imageAlt="F1 Innovation and Development"
				reversed={true}
			/>

			<!-- New Innovations Section -->
			<TwoColumnSection
				title="Harnessing the energy"
				background="gray"
				content={`
          <p>
            One of the emerging topics in the future of Formula 1 is
            sustainability. As a sport that relies heavily on technology and
            resources, F1 has been criticized in the past for its impact on the
            environment. However, in recent years, there has been a shift
            towards sustainability in F1. The sport has set ambitious targets
            for carbon reduction, and teams are investing in more
            environmentally friendly practices, such as using renewable energy
            and reducing waste.
          </p>
          <p>
            Furthermore, F1 is exploring the use of alternative fuels, such as
            biofuels and hydrogen, in an effort to reduce the sport's carbon
            footprint. As the world becomes increasingly focused on
            sustainability, F1 is taking steps to ensure that it remains
            relevant and responsible in the eyes of fans and stakeholders
            alike.
          </p>
      `}
				imageSrc={jp02}
				imageAlt="F1 Innovation and Development"
				reversed={false}
			/>

			<!-- Rookies Showcase Section -->
			<section class="bg-gray-100 py-12">
				<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
					<div class="text-center mb-12">
						<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">What does the future hold?</h2>
						<p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">
							These rising stars are already making headlines. Here's who to watch as Formula 1
							evolves into a new era.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
						<!-- Kimi Antonelli -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Kimi Antonelli</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									Mercedes junior driver making waves in Formula 2 with exceptional race craft and
									maturity beyond his years.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={kimiPortrait}
									alt="Kimi Antonelli driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Oliver Bearman -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Oliver Bearman</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									Ferrari Academy standout showing impressive pace and consistency in Formula 2.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={bearmanPortrait}
									alt="Oliver Bearman driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Isack Hadjar -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Isack Hadjar</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									Red Bull junior proving his worth with aggressive yet calculated racing style in
									Formula 2.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={hadjarPortrait}
									alt="Isack Hadjar driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Gabriel Bortoleto -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Gabriel Bortoleto</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									McLaren junior talent displaying remarkable adaptability and raw speed in his
									rookie F2 campaign.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={bortoletoPortrait}
									alt="Gabriel Bortoleto driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Jack Doohan -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Jack Doohan</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									Alpine Academy driver showcasing F1-level pace and technical understanding in
									Formula 2.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={doohanPortrait}
									alt="Jack Doohan driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Liam Lawson -->
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-200/80">
							<div class="p-6">
								<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Liam Lawson</h3>
								<p class="text-gray-600">
									Red Bull reserve driver with F1 experience, known for his adaptability and
									race-winning potential.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="overflow-hidden">
								<Image
									src={lawsonPortrait}
									alt="Liam Lawson driver portrait"
									class=""
									loading="lazy"
								/>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Latest Blog Posts Section -->
			<LatestBlogPosts />
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
